- UnifiedPush Android connector: Apache-2.0, https://codeberg.org/UnifiedPush/android-connector
- Leaflet: BSD-2-Clause, https://leafletjs.com/
- web-push: MIT, https://github.com/web-push-libs/web-push
- ipaddr.js: MIT, https://github.com/whitequark/ipaddr.js
- Kotlin and transitive Android dependencies: see their distributed licenses.

